  "body": "Imagine starting your day with a walk along Orewa Beach, a swim in the complex pool and a coffee from your favourite café – all just moments from your front door. Tucked away from the main road in the ever-popular Boulevard complex, this spacious townhouse puts you right in the heart of one of Orewa's most desirable beachside locations.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a low-maintenance place to call home, a lock-and-leave holiday escape or a smart investment, this home offers the flexibility to suit. With three bedrooms, two bathrooms and two separate living areas, there's room for everyone. Downstairs, the bedroom with its own ensuite and kitchenette is ideal for guests, teenagers, working from home or even Airbnb accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the kitchen sits at the centre of the home, connecting two light-filled living areas that each open onto their own balcony. One enjoys views towards the reserve and Orewa Beach, while the other overlooks the complex swimming pool, giving you options whether you're entertaining friends or simply relaxing with a book in the sun.\r\n\r\nOutside, there's even more to love. A private patio and BBQ area create another sunny spot to unwind, while the outdoor shower is perfect to wash off sandy feet after the beach. An internal access garage, plus an additional designated car park, add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWith Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants, shops and the surf club all within easy walking distance, it's easy to see why properties in the Boulevard complex are so tightly held. Move in and enjoy it yourself, lock it up between holidays, or add a quality property to your investment portfolio.\r\n\r\nOption to purchase fully furnished, including whiteware.\r\n\r\nContact Leanne Wallace and Cushla Fell at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
